      <slug></slug>
      <title>Xfce 4.6 and then?</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will be about the new &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.xfce.org/&#34;&gt;Xfce&lt;/a&gt; release and it will also try to answer what comes after 4.6.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Some of the new features of Xfce 4.6 will be presented and explained, the release process will be evaluated. Finally, we will give a feature preview for Xfce 4.8.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2891">Jannis Pohlmann</person>
      </persons>
